ike to listen to music when we are eating our breakfast'}, {'sentence_id': 22, 'sentence': 'Three of my closest friends are going to visit him tomorrow'}, {'sentence_id': 23, 'sentence': 'She gave a glass of water to her mother before going to bed'}, {'sentence_id': 24, 'sentence': 'My brother was not feeling very well so he did not go today'}, {'sentence_id': 25, 'sentence': 'We could not guess what was inside the big box on the table'}, {'sentence_id': 26, 'sentence': 'The two friends did not know what time the play would start'}, {'sentence_id': 27, 'sentence': 'She wanted to show us the new toys she got for her birthday'}, {'sentence_id': 28, 'sentence': 'The mother told her son that she wanted him to go to school'}, {'sentence_id': 29, 'sentence': 'An old man took a picture of my sister and her little puppy'}, {'sentence_id': 30, 'sentence': 'Ten different kinds of flowers grow by the side of the road'}, {'sentence_id': 31, 'sentence': 'Put your first name on this paper if you will help tomorrow'}, {'sentence_id': 32, 'sentence': 'The father gave his children some fruit for lunch every day'}, {'sentence_id': 33, 'sentence': 'Please do not make noise while they are reading their books'}, {'sentence_id': 34, 'sentence': 'We sometimes take long walks together if it is warm outside'}, {'sentence_id': 35, 'sentence': 'The snow fell softly this morning before our family woke up'}, {'sentence_id': 36, 'sentence': 'Many people came to help us clean the place after the party'}, {'sentence_id': 37, 'sentence': 'He could see a bird outside if he looked through his window'}, {'sentence_id': 38, 'sentence': 'The teacher wanted the children to learn how to draw a boat'}, {'sentence_id': 39, 'sentence': 'He looked up at his mother and told her he was really happy'}, {'sentence_id': 40, 'sentence': 'I will always laugh when we drive past that ice cream store'}, {'sentence_id': 41, 'sentence': 'I hope that you will be able to show the book to my teacher'}, {'sentence_id': 42, 'sentence': 'Most of my friends came to the surprise birthday party here'}, {'sentence_id': 43, 'sentence': 'He went to the park to take a long walk and saw a blue bird'}, {'sentence_id': 44, 'sentence': 'The phone rang six times before we all rushed to pick it up'}, {'sentence_id': 45, 'sentence': 'She was waiting for over an hour before the doctor returned'}, {'sentence_id': 46, 'sentence': 'Instead of watching television we could play in your garden'}, {'sentence_id': 47, 'sentence': 'The boy carried the toy car in one hand for most of the day'}, {'sentence_id': 48, 'sentence': 'All of us ate dinner and then went over to see the new dogs'}, {'sentence_id': 49, 'sentence': 'The children found a tiny chocolate pig inside each package'}, {'sentence_id': 50, 'sentence': 'The birds near your cabin made a lot of noise outside today'}, {'sentence_id': 51, 'sentence': 'We all thought that the grass needed to be cut twice a week'}, {'sentence_id': 52, 'sentence': 'Never let your dogs play outside unless the cat has come in'}, {'sentence_id': 53, 'sentence': 'The tree in the front yard needs to be cut down by tomorrow'}, {'sentence_id': 54, 'sentence': 'It was hard to know whether we were in the correct position'}, {'sentence_id': 55, 'sentence': 'She could not sleep in the same room as the big scary clown'}, {'sentence_id': 56, 'sentence': 'Have a nice time at the fair and be sure to come home early'}, {'sentence_id': 57, 'sentence': 'There is a big river to cross before you reach the mountain'}, {'sentence_id': 58, 'sentence': 'I did not read all of the book because it was making me sad'}, {'sentence_id': 59, 'sentence': 'Our dogs bark a lot when they see birds walking in the yard'}, {'sentence_id': 60, 'sentence': 'It is fun to travel to the beach when we go with our mother'}, {'sentence_id': 61, 'sentence': 'My sister plays her radio when we have friends at our house'}, {'sentence_id': 62, 'sentence': 'In the distance they could just make out our new lighthouse'}, {'sen